{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ce698f1798f26214d6ff813bba1b72dc.avif?t=1773065785\" width=966 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>YOUR JOB IS SIMPLE. KEEP THE FLOW.</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/832ff0cc73872a45bf5e4b246ea470f6.poster.avif?t=1773065785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/832ff0cc73872a45bf5e4b246ea470f6.webm?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/832ff0cc73872a45bf5e4b246ea470f6.mp4?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Space Chaos, you are assigned to manage cargo traffic inside a space station.<br><br>Your role is simple:<br>keep cargo moving through the sector.<br>Receive it.<br>Redirect it.<br>Send it away.<br><br>That\u2019s the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e6462a38888980a99a41980fdf32fe2a.webp?t=1773065785\" width=966 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>THE CARGO IS THE PROBLEM</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49e678e76a3d754b655764b32317c261.poster.avif?t=1773065785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49e678e76a3d754b655764b32317c261.webm?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49e678e76a3d754b655764b32317c261.mp4?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cargo never stops arriving.<br>Some of it should not exist.<br><br>Radioactive materials, infected or unstable entities,  <br>and objects that leak, contaminate, or randomly teleport players.<br><br><strong>Some cargo is more important than others.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.poster.avif?t=1773065785\" width=105 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.webm?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/e6462a38888980a99a41980fdf32fe2a.webp?t=1773065785\" width=966 height=27 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>EVERY MISTAKE CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/cd592c72a7c4b96a4895a0e4162714f2.poster.avif?t=1773065785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/cd592c72a7c4b96a4895a0e4162714f2.webm?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/cd592c72a7c4b96a4895a0e4162714f2.mp4?t=1773065785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>Things escalate. <br>Systems fail. <br> <br>Sometimes it\u2019s the cargo. <br>Sometimes it\u2019s your team. <br> <br>And somehow, you\u2019re all still in it together.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2819410?t=1773065785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773065785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/6ffd3a8a7cc02fda5a375a43efc55956ee436822/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773065785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/6ffd3a8a7cc02fda5a375a43efc55956ee436822/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773065785","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4097960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ce698f1798f26214d6ff813bba1b72dc.avif?t=1773065785\" width=966 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udea8<strong>YOUR JOB IS SIMPLE. KEEP THE FLOW.</strong>\ud83d\udea8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla